===
which, by omitting the marks of commas ¹ ₁, may be supposed to be represented by the same letters. The Duodene then consists of 3 columns or quaternions of Fifths, and four lines or major trines of Thirds, and its root, which is that of the corresponding decad, @@F@@
>>>
<<<
@@F@@
===
is in the centre of the lowest line but one, so that it is easy to construct a duodene on any note as a root.

@@F@@
