The duodene thus completed by these extreme tones possesses two additional union Thirds, major *D¹*♭ + *F* − *A¹*♭ (or *Ro* + *Fa* − *Lo*) and minor *B₁* − *D* + *F₁*♯ (or ¶ *Ti* − *Re* + *Fi*), and consequently besides the 8 genera of scales of the decad contains @@F@@
