the major scale of *A¹*♭ (major chords *D¹*♭ + *F* − *A¹*♭, *A¹*♭ + *C* − *E¹*♭, *E¹*♭ + *G* − *B¹*♭) and the descending minor scale of *E₁* (minor chords *A₁* − *C* + *E*, *E₁* − *G* + *B₁*, *B₁* − *D* + *F₁*♯), @@F@@
>>>
<<<
