These three last chords cannot be played on the Harmonical. They arose in the days of meantone temperament. The chord of the dominant Seventh omitting the Fifth *E¹*♭ 386 *G* 610 *d¹*♭ had then to be played with tempered notes as *E*♭ 386 *G* 579 *c*♯, @@F@@
